{"name":"Our Little Secret","hex":"#a84b7a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"our","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Determiner","definitions":["Belonging to us, excluding the person(s) being addressed .","Belonging to us, including the person(s) being addressed ."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Misspelling of are."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/our"},{"term":"little","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Small, not large, limited, particularly:","Small, limited in size."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Not much.","Not at all."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/little"},{"term":"secret","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A piece of knowledge that is hidden and intended to be kept hidden. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The key or principle by which something is made clear; the knack."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make or keep secret.","To hide secretly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/secret"}],"entries":[{"title":"Our Little Secret (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Our Little Secret is the third studio album from Belgian electronic band Lords of Acid. It was released in 1997 on Antler-Subway Records. Both musically and lyrically, Lords of Acid maintain the industrial music and sexually charged songs found on their previous album Voodoo-U, but with more of a house feel. Lead vocal duties on Our Little Secret were performed by Jade 4 U. The front CD cover is a photo of a woman from the waist up, while the unfolded CD cover booklet is the completed full-body photograph which reveals an outline of a penis in her blue jeans."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/da/Lords_of_Acid_Our_Little_Secret.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Our_Little_Secret_(album)","wikidata":"Q7111061"},{"title":"Our Little Secret (novel)","blocks":[{"text":"Our Little Secret (ISBN 9781862917231) is a 2007 novel written by South Australian author Allayne Webster. The book focuses on a 14-year-old girl, who is seduced and then sexually abused by a man."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/53/Our_Little_Secret_%28novel%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Our_Little_Secret_(novel)","wikidata":"Q7111060"},{"title":"Our Little Secret (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Our Little Secret is a 2024 American Christmas romantic comedy film directed by Stephen Herek and written by Hailey DeDominicis. It stars Lindsay Lohan, alongside an ensemble cast featuring Ian Harding, Tim Meadows, Jon Rudnitsky, Judy Reyes, Henry Czerny, Chris Parnell, and Kristin Chenoweth. The film was a part of Lohan's creative partnership with Netflix, under which she also executive produced the project."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/f7/Our_Little_Secret_poster.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Our_Little_Secret_(film)","wikidata":"Q124337179"},{"title":"Little Secret","blocks":[{"text":"Little Secret is the third studio album by Canadian singer Nikki Yanofsky. It was released on October 7, 2014. The album charted at number 13 on Billboard's Top Jazz Albums chart, and the single \"Necessary Evil\" reached number 52 on the Canadian Hot 100."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a5/Nikki_Yanofsky_Little_Secret.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_Secret","wikidata":"Q24075176"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/2f/Lords_of_Acid_Our_Little_Secret_Stript.jpg/250px-Lords_of_Acid_Our_Little_Secret_Stript.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2f/Lords_of_Ac